  "details": "When loading into a world other than my set home, the loading bar inches forward in increments of .1%. This also happens with avatars. The loading bar for those, however, randomly changes numbers, and will load fully after >10 minutes, only to then cycle through other avatars the player has worn. Regularly disconnected from worlds with no warning as well.\nOften, worlds will enter a state of \"limbo\". All players move in frames, voices often stop, but no lag otherwise. Leaving and joining back does not fix. Restarting usually fixes, but temporarily.",
